WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:09.500
Welcome to Control HUB, a CMMC readiness and evidence management platform built for defense contractors.

00:10.000 --> 00:21.000
Control HUB helps organizations understand where they stand, organize evidence, track recurring monitoring, manage remediation, and prepare for C3PAO review.

00:21.500 --> 00:32.500
The dashboard gives leadership a quick view of readiness, evidence health, monitoring status, POA&M activity, domain readiness, and recommended next actions.

00:33.000 --> 00:46.500
For organizations getting started, the pre-assessment module reviews Microsoft tenant data, identifies findings, generates evidence requests, and recommends a remediation roadmap.

00:47.000 --> 00:58.500
Findings are tied to CMMC controls and can be converted into POA&M items or used to create evidence requests.

00:59.000 --> 01:10.500
The implementation roadmap shows which actions to complete first, helping teams focus on high-impact work that supports multiple CMMC controls.

01:11.000 --> 01:22.500
Each control includes implementation details, configuration steps, linked evidence, monitoring activities, SSP mapping, and POA&M linkage.

01:23.000 --> 01:35.500
The evidence repository stores screenshots, policies, procedures, logs, and reports — tagged by control, domain, status, owner, and review date.

01:36.000 --> 01:44.500
The monitoring tracker proves ongoing compliance through weekly, monthly, quarterly, and annual operational reviews.

01:45.000 --> 01:52.500
POA&M tracking keeps remediation work tied to controls, owners, risks, due dates, and supporting evidence.

01:53.000 --> 02:00.000
Control HUB generates reports for executives, technical teams, and audit preparation.

02:00.500 --> 02:18.000
One platform — from pre-assessment through implementation, evidence collection, monitoring, remediation, and reporting.

